{"key":"ics/T0843","id":"T0843","name":"Program Download","domain":"ics","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["lateral-movement"],"platforms":["None"],"environments":["ics-ot"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may perform a program download to transfer a user program to a controller. Variations of program download, such as online edit and program append, allow a controller to continue running during the transfer and reconfiguration process without interruption to process control. However, before starting a full program download (i.e., download all) a controller may need to go into a stop state. This can have negative consequences on the…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T0843","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--be69c571-d746-4b1f-bdd0-c0c9817e9068","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.713Z","source_object_version":"1.1","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0038","name":"Application Log Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0038","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9c2fa0ae-7abc-485a-97f6-699e3b6cf9fa","page":"telemetry/DC0038/"},{"id":"DC0110","name":"Asset Inventory","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0110","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--b05a614b-033c-4578-b4f2-c63a9feee706","page":"telemetry/DC0110/"},{"id":"DC0108","name":"Device Alarm","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0108","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9d56be63-3501-4dd3-bb5f-63c580833298","page":"telemetry/DC0108/"},{"id":"DC0085","name":"Network Traffic Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0085","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3772e279-27d6-477a-9fe3-c6beb363594c","page":"telemetry/DC0085/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0752","name":"Detection of Program Download","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0752","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--709e05b2-6400-43a2-9bbf-b64f6017b023","relationship_id":"relationship--14